      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "感じる、鮮やかな音の戯れ！\r\n足音から息遣いまで――全て\r\nエチュードにのせ、モノにしよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "565d4d333d0e9c7d1e5d9b61b41b860751f51430eeb4b403d696a93a8648ec04",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e6930085b893023afea1c67",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "トレーニングは本番さながらに。\r\nあらゆる感情とドラマをぶつけ、\r\n全身で奏でようじゃないか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "43dcfced7176143cb15c96f45a7c3039757809a9a2323933188e7d8c61fd97dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25e77212c9f59b8fa3730a6d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今日は調子がよさそうだ。ほら、\r\n心に耳を傾けると…う～ん、ベネ！\r\n勇ましい大合奏が聞こえるよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dc4456052e3c295bb5b7a1f68ce0e434ab2ab47013ae51b350258ec0fef71e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98151078d4e1d12c89da5643",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "さあ、始めよう！\r\n指揮者がバケッタを振るように、\r\n私を導いてくれるかい？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bbde74f459e4bf803c337550b210dec0b0767a0ad28c0293ceabbd7bfd4d081",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8394979a1fea084db7a71c44",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "フッフッフ、ホッホッホ…\r\nハァ～～～…よし、息は整った。\r\nいつでもいけるよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f4e07c9cd80a09679e82fd25b0639cec3288ef2c42f78725a2c65898503c01e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a373c88ef6bc25b560c4cecf",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ふぅ…頭に音が入ってこない。\r\n今は君のサポートが頼りだ…\r\n代わりに譜面をめくっておくれ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a04d40f032858b4e4194b0419d1582de14651295d35f426bbc6e3c976d47be6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a408a11d8f37e0abb36c9de9",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "んんん…おっと、すまない。\r\n知らぬ間に耳を\r\n閉ざしていたみたいだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b94069d6e1802db4b1ed6859e279b42e1bcba46a1e33d10cd203b791df60492",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5db71ad8ecd15732c824523",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "くっ、これからトレーニングだと\r\nいうのに…なぜなんだ…！\r\n響かない…心に…何も…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49e4bf95297180f40f585734291a06c1550d7e814fa547f1d84457ecb6149f56",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a64893d2248294233e582fab",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "何か、優しい音色をドルチェで\r\n流してくれないか。そうしたら、\r\nトレーニングを頑張れそうだ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "585b7439a595dfbf6c3cc92a70acd77e47b86ce8b8282641f08be1900d4680a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c0ed3f658617776fcd7a729",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "私だって、レースで何度も\r\n観客の耳を喜ばせたい…でも、\r\n今は静かに過ごす時じゃないかな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d39681aa4dd3def0fc4ab5c339259d476a95adfd27cbede7ca5a40b2ad62f53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff3a8fb1f6b205b5d8fbf4a5",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "どうやら、走り過ぎたようだ。\r\n指が、声が、脚が――満足に\r\n動かせないんだ…休ませてほしい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4edc2e840fbee10930ad4f44beaa90a97b1673335bad297763b6fbf1b0c0e1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20022"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20022"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2de20ef2d67cf38411caf6c1",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "はははっ、今日の私は比類なき\r\nソリストさ！至高のレース、\r\n夢のような音楽会に招待するよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46c36baec2f7899df7aea59ba55bc12675503003f62a2a5b52885bd63bcd045a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20023"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20023"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a360bc193a43a71a0476a982",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "非の打ち所のない仕上がりだ。\r\n驚きと感動を響かせる、\r\n絶唱の走りを披露しよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28b58ca6f25afa0d37c9cb11997eeb811175cd442a6687b6a931777b5d9b3b73",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20024"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20024"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c83e5d9a4e6b9c0e3d6f1a5b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "音が弾む、心が弾む！\r\nこの調子で、私の躍動する音を\r\nアニマートに響かせよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8fc3316c826ffa6d20747fe24e7eb7a9d4ee9b4b4738b1fd39546e47ffd1119",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20025"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20025"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d2cd8b1045eb8782a74739f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特等席から熱い視線を頼むよ。\r\n期待以上に応えられそうなんだ――\r\nお返しは、勝利の凱歌さ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c50a6ee0e6c8a2516ed356b21ea730c5b5b3f23baf237dd457d6dc36ff528c90",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20026"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20026"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffc85d39e0cadb6e03b6a853",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "湧きあがるムジカへの情熱は\r\n客席へと広がり、歓喜の音で\r\n満たされるだろうさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36f84daa4c4181391b19ffe3e4b140aa4766c484f6dfe56c16aa660d196fa567",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20027"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20027"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:444cb03af9ed2f3e1863bebc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "君と鍛えたこの脚は、最高の楽器。\r\n名曲を奏で、\r\n人々の魂を揺さぶろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12e0ab814c8224d6624ba0f881b25163b3f88cfbeaa10ad3bf46cac61c762bed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20028"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20028"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a3125f37bb6eb29a2f6577d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皆、開演前からレースへの\r\n高揚をかき鳴らしているね。\r\nふふっ、私も負けずに奏でよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b082d9a053f8e0564f955d39af5ae8529a24edeeda0ddbe8f614d0a0e998571a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20029"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20029"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f891e025a68f2b35b7316db",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "積み重ねを、あるがままに。\r\n…そう、私たちの努力は\r\n決して裏切らないよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad56706d03886f178dbf1bb5046b8bfbf1973c78258eb3f4b23a3923e6895bc5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20030"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20030"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b5482766f14c1307a179281",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ほら、緊張しないで。\r\nレースの終幕――コーダで、\r\n一緒に笑おうじゃないか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62259156c8cb88e41ee0ad949921ccb846eb777a650f8961499931561f409e2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20031"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20031"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae642aeaa8b64e940441c4ae",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ふぅん…調子がズレたまま本番か。\r\n他のムジチスタを窺いつつ、\r\n調律してみよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "273d788fb10e6778ccf5c43826e01f98618c2006f11ef524030d1726a2ae72e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20032"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20032"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64628aeb9bbd61e5f9cc30dd",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "信じて送り出してほしい。\r\n理想の音色が出せなくても、\r\n皆の胸を打ってみせるよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53eadc1e0a24970cf7283db5491aca3c33119bd2aaa9f50a47750cba495c819f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20033"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20033"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e59759e6c0c40e7eddde2a3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ドレミファソラシド～～…っと、\r\nやはり今日の私はこんなものか…。\r\nあとは、どうベストを尽くすかだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fbc04515aca14005ca733d379a749bc723f5a8e4c98d03fd416ae55734881e3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20034"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20034"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13b78c53c150c83c59047c3f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不協和音になろうと、私は奏でる。\r\nレースをゆく音楽家として、\r\nそれだけは譲らないよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "840ecc14a88ff3cf56840a7b08c5049471d4cfd986a9975eeb27d071aa922885",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20035"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20035"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81e07f3f089cb97dd31035a8",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "メインを張るのは難しそうだ…\r\nリードは誰かに任せ、\r\n私は自分の音に集中しよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "457c9c005033195e8bf13df12835b5b06f4cdc75679fed0765b7063dab46b879",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20036"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20036"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dcd3e9f678c39b7f7e7832a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "どうも周りのテンポが速そうだ。\r\n今の私で追いつけるのか…いや、\r\nアドリブでなんとかしてみせる…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56fa46862174f52298cff6799d0af1345986bb6ea738ed378170b5225422cf10",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "20037"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/20037"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20988ec6770d622bd6a9fce7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "スィ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0b878b5b4ced66a3dd3d024ddfe88e672a3a3dfcb17bfc030e5b2ce5e9faa53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
